cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this atlas, please cite it as below, and cite the underlying studies listed on each study page."
title: "717 Atlas: a haplotype-resolved gene atlas for Populus tremula x alba clone INRA 717-1B4"
abstract: >-
  A static, browsable atlas of the 63,960 gene models in the two phased haplotypes of hybrid
  poplar clone 717, integrating GENESPACE synteny across a 12-genome panel, genEra
  phylostratigraphy, Phytozome v5.1 functional annotation, HAP1/HAP2 syntelog Ka/Ks, and a
  652-sample RNA-seq expression atlas drawn from 28 curated studies.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Hsieh
    given-names: Chen
    affiliation: "Tsai Lab, University of Georgia"
  - name: "Claude (Anthropic)"
    alias: "software assistance"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ChenHsieh/poplar-717-atlas"
keywords:
  - Populus
  - hybrid poplar
  - haplotype-resolved genome
  - synteny
  - phylostratigraphy
  - lineage-specific genes
  - expression atlas
license-url: "https://github.com/ChenHsieh/poplar-717-atlas/blob/main/LICENSE"
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-09-04"
